From c5e55a731242d8b142913b3de418c70e5e24e0da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mempool: add stacked CoW speculative mempool overlays

Add copy-on-write speculative mempool overlays (`CMemPoolOverlay`) supporting stacked
pre-consensus transaction staging, fast O(1) ancestor/descendant accounting, and lazy
pending-entry notification from `CTxMemPool::addUnchecked`.
